  Ciphertext u = z * z;
  Ciphertext t2 = u + u - one;
  Ciphertext s = t2 * t2;
  Ciphertext t4 = s + s - one;
  Ciphertext m = t2 * c6;
  Ciphertext q = m + m + c4;
  Ciphertext p = t4 * q;
  Ciphertext result = z * c1;
  result = result + t2 * c2;
  result = result - m;
  result = result + p;
  result = result + c0;
  result.set_output("y");
}
```

I have no further reduction that stays within the allowed operations, so I'm returning the attempt 3 kernel unchanged.

